# ============================================================
#  .gitignore for the Papers repo (Vision + quantization)
#  Goal: keep source code, paper text, results/ and plots/.
#  Ignore large, regenerable artifacts: model weights,
#  exported models, training runs, datasets, caches.
# ============================================================

# --- Model weights & exported formats (large, regenerable) ---
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.engine
*.torchscript
*.mnn
*.param
*.bin
*.tflite
*.pb
# directory-style exports
*_ncnn_model/
*_openvino_model/
*_saved_model/

# Calibration / sample tensors
*.npy

# --- Training & inference run outputs (~1.5 GB) ---
# Contains checkpoints, exported weights, predictions, per-run curves.
runs/

# --- Vision project (not part of this repo) ---
Vision/

# --- Datasets (images + labels) ---
**/datasets/
**/distill_ds/
**/calibration_images/
**/calibration_labels/
**/calib_ds/
# Ultralytics label caches
*.cache

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Logs & temp ---
*.log
*.tmp

# --- Paper write-up (uploaded separately as the complete paper) ---
**/paper/

# --- Embedded sub-repos (have their own .git) ---
**/experiment-agent/

# --- LaTeX build artifacts ---
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============================================================
#  Kept on purpose (NOT ignored): nothing below is matched
#  above, so these stay tracked —
#    quantization/results/   (CSV/JSON metrics + figures/ PNGs)
#    all *.py / *.sh / *.yaml scripts & configs in quantization/
# Only the quantization/ folder is tracked; Vision/ is ignored.
# ============================================================
